{"version":1,"content":"<p>「三哥」苗僑偉出名是愛妻號，與太太戚美珍結婚多年恩愛如初，近日有網民野生捕獲苗僑偉做柴可夫，駕車於旺角出沒，泊車在街頭接老婆，盡顯好老公一面。</p><p>當日苗僑偉雖然戴上Cap帽及墨鏡，但仍難掩星味，網民隔住車窗玻璃都能一眼認出，大讚68歲的苗僑偉依</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.691135+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:14.022541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:14.022541+00:00","content_hash":"34591da8eda135793eb97eccb5a680e5f6a4536c908aad930082ce4885c3b3fb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}